(N'AE-01-P01',N'WF-PIPE-01',N'PH-WF-PIPE-01-01',2,N'Ask what the certified business data says',NULL,NULL,N'For the current quarter, where is pipeline most materially behind plan? Break the gap down by stage, solution area, expected close timing, and account. Identify the largest contributors, distinguish pipeline-volume issues from progression or timing issues, and show the metrics supporting each conclusion. Flag anything the available report cannot answer.',N'Aggregate gap analysis grounded in the enabled MSXI report.',N'Confirm the report, filters, KPI definitions, and interpretation before using the answer in a forecast or management conversation.',NULL,NULL),
