(N'AE-06-P-AE01',N'WF-CONV-01',N'PH-WF-CONV-01-01',2,N'Build the account and conversation brief',NULL,NULL,N'Prepare me for my next conversation with [Account]. Summarize priorities from the last 60 days, sentiment shifts, open commitments, active MSX opportunities, competitive mentions, engaged account-team roles, and missing context. Recommend three talking points and the single ask that best advances the customer decision. Show the source signal for each major claim.',N'Grounded AE conversation brief with source signals, gaps, talking points, and ask.',N'AE verifies current customer context, opportunity strategy, relationship nuance, claims, and ask.',NULL,NULL),
(N'WF-CONV-01-P-AE-JAI',N'WF-CONV-01',N'PH-WF-CONV-01-01',1,N'Rehearse the executive customer conversation',NULL,NULL,N'Use Agent J.ai to role-play the upcoming [meeting type] with [customer or stakeholder]. Use the approved conversation plan and focus on the AE contribution: executive narrative, customer outcome, primary ask, fallback ask, likely questions, and relationship-sensitive responses. Simulate realistic questions or objections, pause for the participant response, then provide coaching on clarity, evidence, listening, and the proposed next step. Identify claims, commitments, technical guidance, or commercial positions that require human or SME review. Do not invent customer facts or make commitments.',N'Interactive role-play, targeted coaching, realistic questions or objections, and a short improvement list.',N'Participant validates customer facts, claims, commitments, technical or commercial guidance, and decides what to change before customer use.',NULL,NULL),
