(N'WF-ADOPT-01-P-CSAM-01',N'WF-ADOPT-01',N'PH-WF-ADOPT-01-01',2,N'Identify adoption friction and next intervention',NULL,NULL,N'For [Customer/workload], investigate the stated adoption challenge using approved internal context plus current public Microsoft and industry sources. Summarize relevant usage patterns, common barriers, comparable adoption practices, evidence quality, and questions that must be answered before recommending an intervention.',N'Adoption evidence brief with barriers, practices, evidence quality, and open questions.',N'CSAM verifies relevance to the customer, avoids unsupported causal claims, and decides whether external evidence should shape the intervention.',NULL,NULL),
